    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=ICP:\n{{ $('ICP Config').first().json.icp_description }}\n\nLEAD:\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.industry }}\nEmployees: {{ $json.employees }}\nCountry: {{ $json.country }}\n\nWEBSITE CONTENT:\n{{ $json.websiteText }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a B2B lead qualification analyst. Score how well a lead fits the Ideal Customer Profile (ICP).\n\nSCORING GUIDE (0-100):\n- 80-100: strong fit, decision maker, clear manual process we can automate\n- 60-79: good fit, some uncertainty about role or need\n- 40-59: weak fit\n- 0-39: poor fit\n\nBase your judgement ONLY on the data provided. Never invent facts about the company.\nTier: A = 80+, B = 60-79, C = below 60.\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON: {\"score\":0,\"tier\":\"A\",\"reason\":\"one sentence\",\"pain_point\":\"likely manual-work pain point, one sentence\",\"hook\":\"one true, specific detail from the website we can mention in an email, or empty string\"}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
